<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Equitable sets IPO price at 113.3 pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine Equitable sets IPO price at 113.3 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Equitable Banking Corp had set its initial public offering price at 113.30 pesos per share, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The offering price is slightly over 19 times the 1997 expected earnings of the bank, he said.</p>
</text>
